    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d807">

                <pb facs="0754" n="748" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg748"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/1542b</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Secretary of
                        State and the Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-05-10">May 10, 1939</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I still believe that any announcement about Palestine at this time by the British
                    Government is a mistake, and I think we should tell them that.</p>
                <p>What can I say to Justice Brandeis?</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d807-a1.xml" xpointer="d807-a1"/>
